    "description": "During the first round of combat in an encounter (after the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Surprise_Round\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surprise Round\">Surprise Round</a>, if any), you can take your turn before any of your allies, but you must use either the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Share_Talent\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Share Talent\">Share Talent</a> Prestige Class ability or a Talent from one of the following Talent Trees as part of your turn: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Commando_Talent_Tree\" title=\"Commando Talent Tree\">Commando Talent Tree</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Leadership_Talent_Tree\" title=\"Leadership Talent Tree\">Leadership Talent Tree</a>, or Military Tactics Talent Tree. On the subsequent round, you return to your normal place in the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Initiative_Order\" title=\"Initiative Order\">Initiative Order</a>.",
